---
# Fixture sources are analysis *inputs*, not maintained code. Their bytes feed
# identity digests, source line numbers, structural-index offsets, and the
# reviewed golden artefacts under tests/golden/. Reformatting them would change
# analysis output and silently invalidate those goldens, so clang-format (and
# the pre-commit hook) must leave this subtree byte-for-byte untouched.
DisableFormat: true
...
